d for humanitarian aid. The Ukrainian military said Russia fired 162 drones and one ballistic missile overnight into Tuesday. “We don’t have any particular expectations,” a senior Ukrainian official told AFP. — AFP In case the Kuwait Times carries an article from an Arabic or any other daily, proper attribution must be given both to the Kuwait Times

